Notes on SB Orders
Comprehensive notes on the SB Orders from 2016 to 2025, organized chronologically by year, are provided below. Where a subsequent SB Order modifies, supersedes, or clarifies an earlier order, the Updated Status is explicitly noted alongside the original rule.
